{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2023-05-31 16:15:00', 'title': 'IFF COMPLETED DIVESTITURE OF SAVORY SOLUTIONS BUSINESS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IFF (NYSE:IFF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED DIVESTITURE OF ITS SAVORY SOLUTIONS BUSINESS UNIT TO PAI PARTNERS (PAI), A LEADING GLOBAL PRIVATE EQUITY FIRM WITH A STRONG FOCUS ON THE FOOD AND CONSUMER INDUSTRY. UNDER PAI OWNERSHIP, SAVORY SOLUTIONS GROUP HAS BEEN REBRANDED TO NOVATASTE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN TASTE INNOVATION WITH HEADQUARTERS IN SALZBURG, AUSTRIA. “THE SALE OF IFF'S SAVORY SOLUTIONS GROUP REPRESENTS OUR CONTIN."}